6148, 'model_name': 'qwen2.5:14b'} id='run--7db241d1-b555-4200-bab5-b015171816d1-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1319, 'output_tokens': 439, 'total_tokens': 1758} 58%|█████▊    | 58/100 [1:02:16<34:19, 49.05s/it]
